<title>UK: BOE gives money mkt 553 mln stg help at set rates.</title>
<headline>BOE gives money mkt 553 mln stg help at set rates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 553 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.  </p>
<p>			    EARLY	1100 GMT   1300 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    1.6 BLN    =	    =	    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY    553 MLN    =	    =	    =</p>
<p>DETAILS</p>
<p> BAND 1  T-BILLS	100 MLN*   =	    =	    =</p>
<p> BAND 2  BANK BILLS   353 MLN*   =	    =	    =</p>
<p> BILLS/FRG TO NOV 4   100 MLN#   =	    =	    =</p>
<p>* INTEREST RATE 5-11/16 PCT (INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE RATES)</p>
<p># INTEREST RATE 5-23/32 PCT</p>
</text>
